{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Saloon Simulator</strong> invites you to become the boss of your own entertainment hall!<br>Are you ready to turn a small bar into a giant gaming complex?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you will serve customers their orders and manage a wide variety of arcade machines. By purchasing and placing classic arcade machines, you can increase your saloon\u2019s appeal and expand your venue by unlocking new areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753880/extras/537f7290e49741729d779f58b312fff3.poster.avif?t=1770974730\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753880/extras/537f7290e49741729d779f58b312fff3.webm?t=1770974730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753880/extras/537f7290e49741729d779f58b312fff3.mp4?t=1770974730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But that\u2019s not all \u2014 just like your customers, you can also enjoy the games! Grow your business while having fun in your own game saloon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753880/extras/a041d879a150610474eac15883b0fa0f.poster.avif?t=1770974730\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753880/extras/a041d879a150610474eac15883b0fa0f.webm?t=1770974730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753880/extras/a041d879a150610474eac15883b0fa0f.mp4?t=1770974730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expandable saloon system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive entertainment equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Service mechanics that increase customer satisfaction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freedom to design your own play area</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing, humorous, and enjoyable simulation experience</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the &quot;Game Saloon&quot; you\u2019ve always dreamed of \u2014 manage it and have fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753880/extras/01ef862733f49b0d1044c5bbfe9c998f.poster.avif?t=1770974730\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753880/extras/01ef862733f49b0d1044c5bbfe9c998f.webm?t=1770974730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753880/extras/01ef862733f49b0d1044c5bbfe9c998f.mp4?t=1770974730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3753880?t=1770974730","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3753880?t=1770974730","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753880/e2e535d26ec556092738e531b247ccdd7d68a5b9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770974730","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753880/e2e535d26ec556092738e531b247ccdd7d68a5b9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770974730","categor